        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v41" value="Both decisions stay in moderator_decision (append-only; decision_reversal_ck requires reverses_decision_id for REVERSAL and APPEAL_OVERTURNED). The estimator and the trust edges already skip FLAGGED_FOR_REEVALUATION outcomes, so the next assessment of either party changes without any engine change. Restoring a flagged outcome after re-evaluation is a later moderator action (FYP-2)." style="shape=note;size=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B26A00;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="470" y="1326" width="1000" height="62" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
